' Rejected: partition inside partition.
' Sub-process grouping is 1 level only. A partition stands for "this
' is one logical sub-process"; nested sub-processes imply hierarchy
' we do not model (break them into separate partitions at the same
' level, or represent the inner one as a separate diagram).
' Rewrite: flatten (use two sibling partitions).
@startuml
start
partition "審査" {
  :書類確認;
  partition "与信チェック" {
    :スコア算出;
    :ブラックリスト照会;
  }
  :最終判定;
}
stop
@enduml
